# Codegen Boundaries

`src/codegen/**` is read-only by convention. Generated by automated tools — never edit manually.

## What is generated

| Path | Generator | Command |
|---|---|---|
| `src/codegen/api/auth/**` | Kubb (from `deps/api/auth.json`) | `pnpm api:generate` |
| `src/codegen/api/product/**` | Kubb (from `deps/api/product.json`) | `pnpm api:generate` |
| `src/codegen/router/route-tree.gen.ts` | TanStack Router | `pnpm router:generate` |

## What each API codegen folder contains

```
src/codegen/api/<domain>/
├── models/    # TypeScript types
├── zod/       # Zod schemas (import from @/lib/zod)
├── tanstack/  # TanStack Query hooks (use*, *QueryOptions, *Infinite)
└── client/    # Raw fetch functions
```

## Make changes through generators — never patch output

- Schema changed → `pnpm api:download` then `pnpm api:generate`
- Route added/renamed → `pnpm router:generate`
- Generation issue → edit `kubb.config.ts` or source schemas in `deps/api/`, then regenerate

## Using generated code

```typescript
// Prefer tanstack hooks
import { useGetApiV1Something } from "@/codegen/api/product";
import { getGetSessionQueryOptions } from "@/codegen/api/auth";  // for loaders

// Types from models
import type { GetSession200 } from "@/codegen/api/auth";
```
